      "content": "The risk management team is skeptical. They're arguing that \"manual review\" of these specific jurisdictional nuances is prone to human error and will be significantly slower than your current processing speed. \n\nIf we move to the static database, we essentially lose the ability to cross-reference these arguments against real-time international case developments. Are you saying that we should just accept a higher risk of error and a slower response time to ensure we aren't using generative modules?",
